## The Vulnerability
This is called the Horizontal Privilage vulnerability,in this lab,this could be also encountered as IDOR.
Developers give access to users using insecure id's as user-controllable parameters.Sometimes,developers use GUID's
globally unique identifers just like obfuscation.But this guid's can be extracted from reviews,posts of the victim.

